  .github/workflows/codeql.yml,project,codeql-action pinned SHA group 1c5b6756
  package-lock.json,project,Resolved dependency graph with consolidated Dependabot bumps
  package.json,project,"Exact CLI/ops/changelog pins; jscpd ^5.4.0; fast-glob devDep removed (unused, cleared braces advisory)"
  scripts/accept-packed.ts,project,Packed-acceptance PM_PATH isolation carried from #122
  scripts/docstring-gate.ts,project,Shared canonical main-invocation guard carried from #122
  scripts/prepare-merge-driver.ts,project,Canonical pm-ops 2026.10.4 launcher recopied byte-for-byte
  test/docstring-gate.test.ts,project,isMainInvocation import moved to main-invocation module
  test/json-export.test.ts,project,Single JSON render in critical-path assertion (jscpd 5 dedupe)
